  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transport Master Plan and Preliminary Feasibility Study for Urban Metro Rail Transit Construction of Chattogram Metropolitan Area in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce traffic congestion and improve the quality of life for citizen in Chattogram through constructing eco-friendly urban metro system, To contribute sustainable economic development through providing a high quality public transit services, To encourage Korean state of the art smart technologies in MRT construction and operations.&#xbc29;&#xae00;&#xb77c;&#xb370;&#xc2dc; &#xc81c;2&#xb3c4;&#xc2dc;&#xc758; &#xc778;&#xad6c;&#xc9d1;&#xc911;, &#xb3c4;&#xc2dc;&#xd655;&#xc7a5;, &#xad50;&#xd1b5;&#xd63c;&#xc7a1;&#xc5d0; &#xb530;&#xb77c; &#xb3c4;&#xc2dc;&#xad50;&#xd1b5; &#xb9c8;&#xc2a4;&#xd130;&#xd50c;&#xb79c;&#xc744; &#xc218;&#xb9bd;&#xd558;&#xc5ec; &#xb3c4;&#xc2dc;&#xad50;&#xd1b5; &#xc778;&#xd504;&#xb77c; &#xac74;&#xc124;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xc0ac;&#xc5c5;&#xcd94;&#xc9c4; &#xadfc;&#xac70;&#xb97c; &#xb9c8;&#xb828;&#xd558;&#xba70;,  &#xd658;&#xacbd;&#xce5c;&#xd654;&#xc801; &#xb3c4;&#xc2dc;&#xcca0;&#xb3c4; &#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c; &#xb3c4;&#xc785;, &#xac74;&#xc124;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc2dc;&#xbbfc; &#xc0b6;&#xc758; &#xc9c8; &#xc81c;&#xace0;</narrative>
